buzzwords:
- - name: Migrations where nobody notices.
    text: Shadow systems and parity reconcilers keep the cutovers quiet. Success
      looks like an unremarkable deploy log.
  - name: Growing Engineers.
    text: Project/tech specs, planning, mentoring — bringing early-career
      engineers up to owning their systems.
  - name: Python, Java, PHP, Scala, Golang.
    text: The language is a detail; just write tests for it!
  - name: TypeScript/JavaScript, SvelteKit, Next.js, React, Node.
    text: We still love you, jQuery! But we love Svelte more...
  - name: I18n, L10n, A11y.
    text: I’ve learned more than I ever thought I wanted to know about character sets,
      locales, and externalization.
  - name: PDF Generation & Printing.
    text: Taking HTML to Print/PDF and building PDFs from PDF templates.
# - name: WordPress Contributor.
#   text: Mostly bug fixes and small enhancements to the WP Core, but its all for
#     the greater good, right?
- - name: WordPress Plugin Maintainer.
    text: Post Password Token, est. September, 2009
